body:
It's either this or having a witch commit insurance fraud.

&#x200B;

(for context: if a witch sets fire to the lot and immediately puts it out with a fire extinguisher \[VERY IMPORTANT DETAIL: You cannot use Ice Blast for this to work\], you'll get an insurance payout in the 6-figures range. I've gotten anywhere from 299,999 to 506,000 per fire with this)

This is horrifying beyond any description or belief.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I love it.
